WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.344
(whooshes)

00:00:01.344 --> 00:00:03.761
(soft music)

00:00:09.401 --> 00:00:10.470
- I hate hugging.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.095
- I love hugging.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:13.813
- I felt like that was coming.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.460
- Sometimes I love hugs
more than breathing.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:19.073
- If it was up to me I'd
greet everyone with a hug.

00:00:19.073 --> 00:00:20.338
- Unless it's somebody I know really well,

00:00:20.338 --> 00:00:22.277
it's always made me like
really uncomfortable.

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:23.110
- I love hugging.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:23.943
(laughs)

00:00:23.943 --> 00:00:24.889
- I hate hugging.

00:00:24.889 --> 00:00:25.992
- Oh really?

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:26.921
- I'm so sorry.

00:00:26.921 --> 00:00:29.046
- Do I like have to make eye contact

00:00:29.046 --> 00:00:31.159
with Jameson as I hug him?

00:00:31.159 --> 00:00:31.992
- No.

00:00:31.992 --> 00:00:32.825
What?

00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:33.658
- Do people do that?

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.152
I don't know.

00:00:35.152 --> 00:00:36.337
- Oh God.

00:00:36.337 --> 00:00:37.170
The moment.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.253
(laughs)

00:00:40.742 --> 00:00:42.153
- [Voiceover] Just take it all in.

00:00:42.153 --> 00:00:43.500
- Yeah I'm taking it in.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.300
- Oh we got ears touching.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.491
- We just stand here like this?

00:00:48.491 --> 00:00:50.434
I'm hyper aware of all or the parts

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:51.305
of our bodies that are toughing.

00:00:51.305 --> 00:00:53.472
(giggles)

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.511
- You're like whimpering.

00:00:57.511 --> 00:00:59.392
It's okay Kevin.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.064
- Don't do that.

00:01:01.064 --> 00:01:02.887
- Your hearts beating very fast.

00:01:02.887 --> 00:01:05.304
- I know because I'm hugging.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.016
(laughter)

00:01:11.176 --> 00:01:13.676
(peppy music)

00:01:19.292 --> 00:01:20.542
- There you go,

00:01:22.403 --> 00:01:24.820
as he almost falls backwards.

00:01:28.766 --> 00:01:30.472
- I feel like we're more
friends than we'd have been

00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:32.423
if we stood here for 20 seconds not like,

00:01:32.423 --> 00:01:33.256
- yeah.

00:01:33.256 --> 00:01:34.222
- Just like hanging out.

00:01:34.222 --> 00:01:36.033
- You don't normally hug people for more

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:38.030
than like maybe even three seconds,

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.271
so the fact that we did it 20 seconds

00:01:40.271 --> 00:01:43.533
kind of like, created
that sense of we're there

00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:44.366
for each other.

00:01:44.366 --> 00:01:45.867
- I think people should hug more.

00:01:45.867 --> 00:01:50.034
I feel like the world would
be a much better place.

00:01:58.383 --> 00:02:00.633
(whooshes)

